          "prompt": "Use this image as the exact visual template (scene environment, camera angle, physical props, and layout structure) to create a faithful variation branded specifically for project\\ciel:\n\n=== [PROJECT\\CIEL BRAND CALIBRATION DIRECTIVE] ===\n• Faithful Scene Replication: Recreate the EXACT core scene concept, camera angle, and layout of the reference image.\n• Color Architecture: Calibrate all colors to project\\ciel palette: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C) shadow wells, Crisp White (#FFFFFF) text, Muted Platinum (#E2E2E8) accents, Studio Slate (#141418), and Brushed Titanium / Warm Golden Amber caustics.\n• Relatable Model & Wardrobe: Natural, authentic, approachable young creative founder / designer with genuine expression, styled in effortless, relatable creator wardrobe (clean heavyweight black cotton tee, relaxed overshirt, minimalist crewneck, or clean black blazer with relaxed pants). Grounded, high-taste, and relatable.\n• Mandatory Branding: Integrate \"// project\\ciel · AUTEUR DIRECTING\", \"[CIEL · 2026]\", and adapt featured objects/balloons to spell \"CIEL\" or \"STORY\".\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Style Name: Streetwear Decal Banana Object\n• Genre: Streetwear Product Concept / Physical Hero Object\n• Background: Pure solid white studio backdrop with zero background clutter.\n• Header & Navigation: Stacked bold grotesque headline in background (\"Hungry(O'Clock) Packaging Concept\") with fine copyright stamps (\"©2025 Blender (mdr)\").\n• Typography Hierarchy: Heavy condensed grotesque sans-serif in solid black, layered behind and in front of the central physical object.\n• Color Palette & Containers: #FFFFFF crisp white seamless, text: #000000 pure black, colors: #A3E635 neon lime recycling badge, #C084FC purple monster decal\n• Stickers & Accents: Central physical hero object completely covered in graphic streetwear decals, circular brand stamps, purple monster cartoon sticker, and green recycling icon.\n• Lighting & Finish: Studio macro photography lighting, soft natural contact shadow, authentic physical skin texture, razor-sharp 50mm clean prime.\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"NANO BANANA RECIPE\"\nMain Headline: \"how to make $5k luxury brand posters in 3 minutes.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"luxury, posters, 3 minutes\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"You do not need Photoshop or complex 3D software. Just this simple reference formula.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"SWIPE FOR THE PROMPT →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: white background, skate stickers, grotesque typography.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials.",
