ghting & Finish: Studio macro photography lighting, soft natural contact shadow, authentic physical skin texture, razor-sharp 50mm clean prime.\n\n=== [SLIDE 3 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 3 of 8 (STEP1)\nCard Counter Tag: \"03 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"STEP 01: THE GRID\"\nMain Headline: \"step 1: pick a grid reference layout.\"\nHighlight Focus: Emphasize keywords \"grid reference, layout\" in the reference style container\nSubtitle / Description: \"Never start from scratch. Upload a graphic poster you love to guide the structure.\"\nBody Points:\n  1. \"Choose a poster with bold stacked typography and clean grid lines\"\n  2. \"Let Nano Banana analyze the spacing, fonts, and color contrast\"\n  3. \"Keep the background minimal (off-white  or deep black)\"\nCallout Box: \"PRO TIP: Reference images act as the blueprint for your typography.\"\nBottom Prompt: \"STEP 2: THE PROMPT →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, flat 2D graphic poster aesthetic, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.\n\n=== [SELF-CHECKER STRICT FIDELITY ENFORCEMENT] ===\nMandatory Reference Visual Signatures: Ensure the output strictly incorporates: white background, skate stickers, grotesque typography.\nDo not deviate from the reference image's visual composition and materials."
